Feature: TC_26_STAFF - OpenShift Map Printing E2E Regression Pack

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Legacy  : "Regression Pack for Openshift Map Printing Regression Cases" (BISSAGL-12728, AT-TC-01 to 05,
  #           tmslinks BISSAGL-18579 / 18583 / 18586 / 18589 / 18591)
  # Rewritten 16-10-2026 in the StaffSteps vocabulary (the wording the MAPS features run with). One end-to-end
  # scenario on the OpenShift deployment; # SECTION markers show where each legacy scenario starts.
  #
  # Purpose:
  #   Map Printing on OpenShift: a map from a herd search and one from a parcel search are generated, reach their final
  #   status and can be downloaded; an unknown herd, an invalid parcel and empty searches are handled.
  #
  # Legacy coverage notes carried forward:
  #   - AT-TC-03 (unknown herd ABDAAPT) had no check in legacy; the search runs the same way.
  #   - The validation error step switches the screen back to herd search, as the MAPS packs do.
  #
  # Test data:
  #   Herds and LPIS parcels from the database ("Get Submitted Herds", "Get LPIS Parcels"), as in legacy; ABDAAPT is
  #   the legacy literal for an invalid herd and parcel.
  #   Login agr11612 (map printing user, as in legacy). Password: TD:Password from the TestData row of this test case.
  #
  # Step definitions: stepdefinitions.BISS.STAFF.StaffSteps (Map Printing)
  # Author: Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Background:
    Given the staff user is logged in to the OpenShift BISS portal as "agr11612"
    And the staff user is on the Map Printing screen

  @regression @staff @openshift @maps @e2e
  Scenario: AT-STAFF-OS-MAPS-E2E-01 - Staff generates and downloads maps on OpenShift and checks the search validations

    # SECTION 1 : Map from a herd search, details, final status, download - AT-TC-01 (BISSAGL-18579)
    When the staff user searches Map Printing for the next submitted herd for scheme year "2023"
    Then the staff user should see the herd identity details
      | name    |
      | address |
    When the staff user requests a map with the following settings
      | parcels | single              |
      | mapType | Full Color Ortho A4 |
      | legend  | yes                 |
    Then the generated map should be recorded with the following details
      | status     |
      | id         |
      | herdNumber |
      | date       |
    And the generated map should reach its final status
    And the staff user should be able to download the generated map

    # SECTION 2 : Map from a parcel search, final status, download - AT-TC-02 (BISSAGL-18583)
    When the staff user is searching by parcel
    And the staff user searches Map Printing for the next LPIS parcel for scheme year "2023"
    And the staff user requests a map with the following settings
      | parcels | single               |
      | mapType | Inspection Discovery |
      | legend  | yes                  |
    Then the generated map should reach its final status
    And the staff user should be able to download the generated map

    # SECTION 3 : Unknown herd - AT-TC-03 (BISSAGL-18586)
    When the staff user is searching by herd
    And the staff user searches Map Printing for herd "ABDAAPT" for scheme year "2023"

    # SECTION 4 : Invalid parcel - AT-TC-04 (BISSAGL-18589)
    When the staff user is searching by parcel
    And the staff user searches Map Printing for parcel "ABDAAPT" for scheme year "2023"
    Then the staff user should see the validation error "Parcel number is invalid"

    # SECTION 5 : Empty herd and parcel searches - AT-TC-05 (BISSAGL-18591)
    When the staff user searches Map Printing with no herd number
    Then the staff user should see the validation error "Herd number required."
    When the staff user is searching by parcel
    And the staff user searches Map Printing with no parcel number
    Then the staff user should see the validation error "Parcel number required."
